# Motelyra / موتيليرا — Privacy Policy

Updated: 30 October 2026

Motelyra is the new name of Recolte de Mots. This policy covers the Android
game with package name `com.wordcrushfr.word_crush`, published on Google Play
by **housie**. Privacy and support contact: **banditscreator@gmail.com**.

## 1. Check which version you use

The offline **0.4.1** version differs from older releases such as **0.2.3**.
The offline version does not add accounts, ads, analytics, cloud saving or
real-money purchases. Older installed versions can still have these features.
The sections below distinguish their data practices.

## 2. Offline version 0.4.1

The game stores the following on your device: language and age group;
completed and unfinished puzzles; stars, coins and hints; unlocked items;
current and best daily streaks; and sound, vibration and animation preferences.

It does not request your name, email address, exact birth date, photographs
or location. It does not send player data to the publisher's servers and does
not include advertising, analytics, account, cloud-sync or real-money purchase
SDKs. The age group is a local preference, not an online account or a precise
date of birth.

Local data remains in app storage until you erase it through the game's
Settings, clear app storage in Android, or uninstall the game. Android may
separately back up or transfer app data according to the device's settings
and backup provider; the game itself provides no cloud synchronization.
You can manage operating-system backups through your device settings.

## 3. Older releases, including 0.2.3

Older releases include Google Play Billing, Google Mobile Ads and Firebase
services. Their data handling depends on the features you use, permissions,
consent and device settings:

- Google sign-in and Firebase Authentication can process an account identifier
  and profile information provided through the selected Google account, such
  as a name, email address and profile photo. Cloud game features can store
  progress, solved words and coin balances linked to the account identifier.
- When advertising is used, Google Mobile Ads can collect and share IP
  addresses (which may indicate approximate location), device/account
  identifiers, app/ad interactions and diagnostic or performance information
  for advertising, measurement and fraud prevention.
- Legacy Firebase notification features can process installation/registration
  identifiers to deliver notifications when enabled. Statistics features,
  where enabled, can process usage and device information.
- Google Play handles real-money payment processing in legacy purchase
  features. The publisher does not receive your full payment-card details
  through the Google Play Billing SDK.

Updating or uninstalling the game does not itself request deletion of earlier
cloud records. The offline version does not resume or synchronize a legacy
cloud account. Contact banditscreator@gmail.com to request information about
or deletion of earlier account/cloud data. Include enough information to
identify the relevant game account, but do not send passwords, authentication
codes or payment-card details. Identity may need to be verified before
accessing or deleting account data. Data handled by Google services is also
subject to their policies and the controls in your Google/device account.

Relevant provider information:

- [Google Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy)
- [Google Mobile Ads data disclosure](https://developers.google.com/admob/android/privacy/play-data-disclosure)
- [Firebase privacy and security](https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy)

## 4. Support correspondence

If you voluntarily email support, your email address and the information you
include are received through the publisher's email provider to handle your
request. Send only what is needed. Do not include sensitive information in
screenshots unless it is necessary for the request.

## 5. Audience and children

The intended audience is stated on Google Play. The offline version does not
request an exact date of birth or collect an online child profile. A parent
or guardian with concerns about information provided through an older
version can contact banditscreator@gmail.com. A content rating is separate
from the intended audience and from consent to a third-party service.

## 6. Security, changes and contact

Keep your device protected and review its storage, backup, advertising and
notification controls. No storage or transmission method can guarantee
absolute security. This policy will be updated when the game's distributed
data practices change. The update date appears at the top.

Contact: **banditscreator@gmail.com**.

